ementally:\n\nStep 1: Create base components on workspace (off-canvas area) — Button is given (use as-is), Text Field given (use as-is). Create:\n- Section Heading (Archivo Black 48)\n- Rating stars row component? Just inline.\n- Product Card component (parameterized by instance — but easier to create per-card directly since image differs)\n\nTo keep token budget manageable, I'll create \"primitive components\" once (announcement bar, header, newsletter, footer, breadcrumb, pagination, stepper, chips, review card, cart line item, product card) and reuse instances across pages, overriding text/images per instance where needed. Instances support text override and fill override.\n\nActually simpler approach: Build components with default content. When instantiating, override text via findChildren.\n\nLet me build a comprehensive script. I'll split into multiple use_figma calls:\n\nCall A: Setup workspace page, define helpers, create base primitives (color swatch component, size chip component, rating row component, stepper component, pagination, breadcrumb).\n\nCall B: Create Announcement Bar + Header + Footer + Newsletter components.\n\nCall C: Create Product Card component, Review Card component, Style Tile, Filter Panel, Gallery, Cart Line Item, Order Summary, Tabs.\n\nCall D-G: Build 4 frames using instances.\n\nCall H: Wire prototype interactions.\n\nFinal: Screenshots + fixes.\n\nComponents will live on the workspace page in a \"Components\" area at the top (e.g., a frame at x=-2000 or far below). Actually putting them on the workspace page is fine — frames can sit anywhere.\n\nLet me structure layout decisions:\n\nGrid: 1440 wide, content width 1240 (margins 100 each side). Sections separated.\n\nHome (01_Home):\n- Announcement bar (38px)\n- Header (~96px)\n- Hero (~663px) — split: left content (heading, copy, shop now btn, stats), right photo with sparkles\n- Brands strip (black bg, 122px) — wordmarks\n- New Arrivals (~500px) — heading + 4 product cards + View All\n- Divider\n- Top Selling (~500px)\n- Browse by dress style (~866px) — heading + 4 tiles in grid (2 rows: casual wide+formal narrow? Original: casual 407, formal 684, party 684, gym 407)\n- Our Happy Customers (~415px) — heading + prev/next arrows + 3 review cards\n- Newsletter (~180px card)\n- Footer (~470px)\n\nTotal home height ~ 4500-4900.\n\nCategory (02):\n- Announcement + Header + Breadcrumb\n- Content: filters left (295px), products right (925px): results header, 3x3 grid (9 cards), pagination\n- Newsletter + Footer\nHeight ~3900.\n\nProduct (03):\n- Announcement + Header + Breadcrumb\n- Gallery left + summary right (~700px)\n- Tabs + Reviews section (~1200px)\n- You might also like (~500px)\n- Newsletter + Footer\nHeight ~4300.\n\nCart (04):\n- Announcement + Header + Breadcrumb\n- Title \"YOUR CART\"\n- Cart items left + Order summary right\n- Newsletter + Footer\nHeight ~2300.\n\nLet me now write the code. I'll keep the components simple but well designed.\n\nKey design tokens:\n- Colors:\n  - black: #000000\n  - white: #FFFFFF\n  - surface: #F0F0F0\n  - surfaceLight: #F8F8F8 (cards bg) — actually product card bg is #F0EEED\n  - textPrimary: #000000\n  - textSecondary: rgba(0,0,0,0.6)\n  - textTertiary: rgba(0,0,0,0.4)\n  - border: rgba(0,0,0,0.1)\n  - star: #FFC633\n  - discount: #FF3333, discountBg: rgba(255,51,51,0.1)\n  - verified: #01AB31\n  - sale red: #FF3333\n\n- Type:\n  - Display H1: Archivo Black 64 (hero)\n  - H2 section: Archivo Black 48\n  - Product name: Plus Jakarta Sans Bold 20\n  - Body: Plus Jakarta Sans Regular 16\n  - Price: Plus Jakarta Sans Bold 24\n  - Small: 14\n\nLet me now write code step by step. To save tokens, I'll batch operations.\n\nStep 1: Setup + primitives.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c5b3498c-81e1-408a-9e23-797293d6b873","uuid":"1508ae5a-0138-4d05-a514-efddc6016ddb","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:12:35.153Z","thinking_duration_ms":38572}
