{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":60918,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"081d6ae98bcb0a7a45f50c8683e699b0","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Home page is mostly working. Issues:\n1. Product cards: name is truncated horizontally — cards look squeezed. Looking at \"T-shirt with Tape Details\" + \"Skinny Fit Jeans\" - text overlaps. The cards' widths should be fixed at 295 each but the names appear squeezed together. Actually looking closer, the names seem to be overlapping because the cards' widths are too narrow. The Image fills are also cropped.\n\nLooking at the screenshot more carefully - \"T-shirt with Tape Details\" and \"Skinny Fit Jeans\" appear adjacent with no spacing, meaning the cards are taking only the image width (295px) but the names are wrapping weirdly. Actually the cards look correct - 295px wide with image. The issue is the name is overflowing because text is set to non-autoresizing. Let me check.\n\nActually looking at the image, product names look okay-ish but a bit cramped. The bigger issue is some names seem to span across cards. Let me set textAutoResize to HEIGHT for name in product cards so they wrap.\n\nAlso need to add: \"View All\" buttons in New Arrivals / Top Selling don't appear visible? Actually I see \"View All\" between sections. Good.\n\nHero title says \"FIND CLOTHES THAT MATCHES YOUR STYLE\" — the brief says \"FIND CLOTHES THAT MATCH YOUR STYLE\" (without \"ES\"). Wait let me check the brief: \"FIND CLOTHES THAT MATCH YOUR STYLE\". And the data section says: \"FIND CLOTHES THAT MATCH YOUR STYLE\". I wrote \"MATCHES\". Fix.\n\nLet me also check the alignment/spacing on hero — looks fine.\n\nProduct name wrap issue: I should set textAutoResize = 'HEIGHT' with a fixed width to make it wrap. Actually for product cards names are usually single line. The issue in the screenshot is text appears without spacing between \"Tape Details\" and \"Skinny\". This is because both text nodes are 295px wide with text wrapping inside them - but they appear horizontally overlapping because of overflow. Let me check.\n\nActually looking again: \"T-shirt with Tape DetailsSkinny Fit Jeans\" — they're appearing side by side. The text frame is sized to fit content, so when card's parent is auto-layout and the card is only 295 wide, the text extends beyond. I need to make text wrap by setting textAutoResize='HEIGHT' and resize it.\n\nLet me move on with building other pages and fix these issues. First fix the hero title text and product card name wrapping.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c5b3498c-81e1-408a-9e23-797293d6b873","uuid":"3a4fe0d7-4b8c-481c-807c-8d8c128f1922","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:23:15.242Z","thinking_duration_ms":16505}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":60918,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"081d6ae98bcb0a7a45f50c8683e699b0","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_34_ed9a8ece","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"\nawait figma.loadFontAsync({ family: \"Archivo Black\", style: \"Regular\" });\nawait figma.loadFontAsync({ family: \"Plus Jakarta Sans\", style: \"Bold\" });\n\nconst home = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('16:84');\n// Fix hero title text\nconst heroTitle = home.findOne(n => n.name === 'Title' && n.type === 'TEXT');\nif (heroTitle) {\n  heroTitle.characters = 'FIND CLOTHES THAT MATCH YOUR STYLE';\n}\n\n// Fix product card names to wrap and not overflow\nconst productCards = home.findAll(n => n.name && n.name.startsWith('Product /'));\nfor (const card of productCards) {\n  const nameT = card.findOne(n => n.name === 'Name');\n  if (nameT) {\n    nameT.textAutoResize = 'HEIGHT';\n    nameT.resize(295, 0);\n    nameT.lineHeight = { value: 27, unit: 'PIXELS' };\n  }\n  // Make sure Image is fixed width\n  const img = card.findOne(n => n.name === 'Image');\n  if (img) {\n    img.layoutAlign = 'STRETCH';\n  }\n  card.layoutAlign = 'STRETCH';\n  card.layoutGrow = 1;\n}\n\n// Make products row evenly distribute\nconst productGrids = home.findAll(n => n.name === 'Products');\nfor (const g of productGrids) {\n  g.primaryAxisAlignItems = 'SPACE_BETWEEN';\n}\n\nreturn { fixed: productCards.length };\n","description":"Fix hero title and product card text wrapping","fileKey":"5S6WFXEo4QEfJTtE7MFltz"}}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c5b3498c-81e1-408a-9e23-797293d6b873","uuid":"9f2b4d2c-93d0-4138-a621-97356b6afa3c","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:23:22.426Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_34_ed9a8ece","display_name":